    <details key="documentation" value="The OGC SensorThings API 1.1 data model (OGC 18-088), as a projection target of the change stream: target object = Thing, TIMESERIES slot = Datastream, target feature = ObservedProperty, source class = Sensor, entry = Observation. Annotations with source https://eclipse.org/fennec/sta/wire mark a value type written as JSON (type=json, geojson). The wire properties over several attributes (phenomenonTime, resultTime, validTime as intervals; result over resultNumber/resultBoolean/resultText) are the wire mapping of the STA profile, not part of this model."/>
